'''Chiseled cinnabar''' is a decorative [[chiseled]] variant of [[cinnabar]] used for building.

== Obtaining ==
=== Breaking ===
Chiseled cinnabar drops as an item if mined by any [[pickaxe]]. If mined without a pickaxe, they drop nothing.
{{Breaking row|Chiseled Cinnabar|Pickaxe|horizontal=1}}

