{{Stonecutting|Polished Cinnabar;Cinnabar Bricks|Chiseled Cinnabar|foot=1|description={{only|BE}}}}

== Usage ==
Chiseled cinnabar is only used for decoration.

=== Sulfur cube ===
[[Sulfur cube]]s have the ability to absorb chiseled cinnabar, either through picking it up or being interacted with it. This provides the regular/football effect to the mob when hitting it.

